UPDATE characters SET data = '{"slug":"desire-reader","name":"Desire Reader","team":"townsfolk","ability":"Each day, privately choose a player: learn a trait they share with the previous player. You are sober & healthy only if they are.","creator":"legitch","appearsIn":"SCP Fragmented Veil","lede":"The Desire Reader (SCP-978) is a camera that can peer into the minds of others through the photographs it makes of those targets, revealing their souls.","summaryBullets":["Each day, the Desire Reader chooses a player to compare with the previously chosen player.","They can learn any fact provided that it relates to something both players share, such as an ability trait, or what they did at night.","The Desire Reader learns nothing on the first day","It is up to the Desire Reader to talk with the Storyteller, not the other way around. This isn''t a public conversation, and the group can''t listen in. It''s private.","The Desire Reader can choose not to visit the Storyteller if they wish.","The Desire Reader is normally sober and healthy, even if another ability targeted at the Desire Reader would make them drunk or poisoned.","However, if the Desire Reader chooses a drunk or poisoned player with their ability, they will be under drunk and poisoned behaviour, and will receive arbitrary information with their ability for that use.","The Desire Reader can choose themselves if they freely wish, and the Storyteller may give weaker information as a result."],"howToRun":["Once per day, if the Desire Reader requests a private chat with you, take them away from the circle so you cannot be overheard. They will choose a player. If there is a player marked with the **PREVIOUS** reminder token, whisper a fact about a commonality they share to the Desire Reader. Mark the chosen player with the **PREVIOUS** reminder token. Note that the Desire Reader is not affected by drunkenness and poisoning normally, but will receive arbitrary results should the player they select be, if so, mark them with the **DROISONED** reminder token until they choose a sober & healthy player again. If you cannot think of a thought-read straight away, either take your time or ask them to come back in a few minutes."],"tips":["Remember, the Desire Reader will be unaffected by conventional sources of drunkenness and poisoning unless their most recent choice was drunk or poisoned. This means that you should be cautious with how you tune the information you give to the Desire Reader each day. Try and aim for information that''s on par with an ''Each night/each night*'' Townsfolk''s ability."],"quote":"See foe''s remaining HP. Press [A Button](https://mario.wiki.gallery/images/b/b9/Switch_A_Button.svg) for secrets!","iconBy":"le_nuberto","jinxes":[{"name":"No Dashii","align":"evil","text":"The No Dashii''s poison skips over the Desire Reader.","id":"nodashii"},{"name":"Caruncula","align":"evil","text":"The Caruncula''s poison skips over the Desire Reader.","slug":"caruncula"},{"name":"Autarch","align":"evil","text":"The Desire Reader can normally be poisoned by the Autarch.","id":"autarch_hblreleased"}],"customBoxes":[{"title":"Alternative JSON (Older)","content":"If you feel like using the older Desire Reader where it ambiguously learned what a player is \"thinking\" at the present moment, use this JSON. Good for more casual and groups that prioritize having fun more than winning, but may not necessarily be better than the current text.\n\n**Desire Reader ' || char(9608) || '~** (Townsfolk)\nEach day, privately choose a player: learn what they are \"thinking\".\n\n**Reminders:** Droisoned, Previous\n**Credit:** Ability: @legitch. Image: @le_nuberto."}],"firstNight":0,"otherNight":0,"reminders":["Droisoned","Previous"],"setup":false,"art":"art/desire-reader.png","jsonId":"desirereader_scp_fragmented_veil","curata":false}' WHERE slug='desire-reader';
